# Keep secrets, local data, tests and cruft out of the Docker image.
.git
.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.bak
**/_backup_*
data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
secret.key
**/secret.key
# A developer's local certificate copy (gitignored, so CI never sees it — this guards a local
# `docker build`). The image carries the build's own pair, hash-pinned, in
# poller/mate_api_runtime/application_certificate/; nothing else may stand in for it. Keep .gitkeep.
certs/app.crt
certs/app.key
certs/*.pem
tests/
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore

.venv*
.pytest_cache
